    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Campbells are delighted to have been instructed to bring this Beautifully Presented 3-Bedroom property to the open market.\n\n\nSet in a peaceful location just a minute from Burtonport and a short drive to Dungloe town, this Property presents itself as an Ideal Family / Holiday Home\n\nThe Accommodation Comprises a Spacious open-plan Living Room / Kitchen / Dining Area with Patio Doors that fill the space with natural light, there are also two well-proportioned Bedrooms and a Family Bathroom. \n\nExternally there is a Decking Area with lends itself to various uses \n\nA Charming Spiral Staircase leads to the first floor, where you`ll find a generous Master En-Suite Bedroom \n\n\nConveniently located near Burtonport Village and Dungloe town, Shops, Restaurants, Cafes, and range of Amenities are all located within a short distance \n\n\nViewing is highly recommended by STRICT appointment only.\n\n\nOur Ref: K1316"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 4.52m (14'10\") x 2.09m (6'10\")\nLarge Tiles\n\nLiving / Dining / Kitchen - 7.62m (25'0\") x 4.36m (14'4\")\nOpen Fireplace, Fully Fitted Kitchen,Tiled Splash back\n\nHallway - 3.24m (10'8\") x 1.16m (3'10\")\nLaminate Wood Floor\n\nBathroom - 2.63m (8'8\") x 2.08m (6'10\")\nFully Tiled, Bath, Vanity Unit Basin, Toilet\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.22m (13'10\") x 3.82m (12'6\")\nLaminate Wood Floor\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.54m (11'7\") x 2.43m (8'0\")\nLaminate Wood Floor\n\nLanding - 1.13m (3'8\") x 1.13m (3'8\")\nLaminate Wood Floor\n\nBedroom 3 (En Suite) - 4.27m (14'0\") x 4.1m (13'5\")\nLaminate Wood Floor\n\nEn Suite (Bed 3) - 2.19m (7'2\") x 2.1m (6'11\")\nFully Tiled, Shower, Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
